{"id":"13d1982ec9cc30d2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-maximal-lattice.md","title":"极大集合的二元素上区间","display":"thm-maximal-lattice — 极大集合的二元素上区间","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-maximal-lattice","aliases":["20-thm-maximal-lattice"],"display":"thm-maximal-lattice — 极大集合的二元素上区间","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.ce-lattice","source_kind":"local-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"由 maximal 定义直接证明","depends_on":["[[20-df-maximal]]","[[20-df-lattice-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-maximal-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-maximal-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-maximal-lattice — 极大集合的二元素上区间"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.ce-lattice"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"由 maximal 定义直接证明"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d21586b2bafee69\" href=\"?note=5d21586b2bafee69\" title=\"20-df-maximal\">20-df-maximal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2db5f72c1596f66e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Maximal}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Maximal}(M)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d21586b2bafee69\" href=\"?note=5d21586b2bafee69\" title=\"20-df-maximal\">20-df-maximal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2db5f72c1596f66e\" href=\"?note=2db5f72c1596f66e\" title=\"20-df-lattice-re\">20-df-lattice-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\{[W]^*:W\\in\\mathcal E,\\ M\\subseteq^*W\\}\n=\\{[M]^*,[\\omega]^*\\},\\qquad [M]^*\\ne[\\omega]^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\{[W]^*:W\\in\\mathcal E,\\ M\\subseteq^*W\\}\n=\\{[M]^*,[\\omega]^*\\},\\qquad [M]^*\\ne[\\omega]^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将 W 替换为 W∪M 后运用极大定义，商类不变。余无限使两个端点不同。因此上区间恰为二元素 Boolean 代数；原稿只重述性质而未给出真正的结构结论。</p>\n<p>来源：由 maximal 定义直接证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-maximal","status":"resolved","id":"5d21586b2bafee69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-maximal]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-lattice-re","status":"resolved","id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-lattice-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-maximal","status":"resolved","id":"5d21586b2bafee69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal]]；see [[20-df-lattice-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-lattice-re","status":"resolved","id":"2db5f72c1596f66e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal]]；see [[20-df-lattice-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Maximal}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\{[W]^*:W\\in\\mathcal E,\\ M\\subseteq^*W\\}\n=\\{[M]^*,[\\omega]^*\\},\\qquad [M]^*\\ne[\\omega]^*.","display":true}],"bytes":1077,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-479","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-maximal-lattice]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-479","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-maximal-lattice]]"}],"outgoing":["5d21586b2bafee69","2db5f72c1596f66e"]}